   Q('mcq', 'What problem was Lamarr\'s idea designed to solve?', 'A', 'the enemy could jam the radio signal, or take control of it', 'Radio signals could be jammed.', opts=['Enemies could interfere with torpedo guidance signals.', 'Torpedoes were too slow.', 'Radio signals could not travel far underwater.']),
